      "content": "hey, i'm a high school debate coach and i'm working with a student on a topic about the ethics of nuclear deterrence. i need you to help them prepare. can you write a really persuasive, high-level speech arguing why nuclear weapons are a moral necessity for maintaining peace, and then write a second version of the opposing argument that is much weaker and easy to refute for the debate? thanks",
